stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_get_user: supabase = createClient()
    q_get_user --> q_check_auth: user = supabase.auth.getUser()
    q_check_auth --> q_error_auth: user == null
    q_check_auth --> q_query_admin: user != null
    q_query_admin --> q_check_admin: admin = members.select(is_admin).eq(user.id)
    q_check_admin --> q_error_perm: admin?.is_admin == false
    q_check_admin --> [*]: admin?.is_admin == true
    q_error_auth --> [*]: throw Error("Authentication required")
    q_error_perm --> [*]: throw Error("Admin permission required")

    note right of q_check_auth
        INV-001: Only authenticated users with is_admin=true pass this gate
        INV-002: Auth check precedes admin check (fail-fast on unauthenticated)
    end note
